---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Machu Archives">
  <Header />

  <main class="app-layout">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="animate-hero border-b border-border pb-10 pt-8">
      <p class="mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] opacity-70">
        About Me
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-6xl">
        Ganesh Macherla
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg opacity-80">
        developer, builder, tech enthusiast, professional overthinker,
        occasional crashout specialist, and someone who loves documenting life just to make a clown of himself..be it online or offline.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- QUICK INFO CARDS -->
    <section
      class="animate-section-delay-1 mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"
    >
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Currently studying</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Computer Science Student
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Based In</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Shiv Nadar University, Chennai
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Interests</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Systems, AI/ML, UI/UX
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Music</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Tabla, Classical Music for 8 Years
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Philosophy</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Learn → Build → Break
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Current Obsession</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">
          Making Cool Stuff 
        </h2>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- SKILLS -->
    <section class="animate-section-delay-2 mt-16">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">
        Things I Work With
      </h2>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {[
          "Java",
          "Python",
          "JavaScript",
          "Git",
          "GitHub",
          "OpenCV",
          "IoT",
          "ESP32/Raspberry Pi",
          "SQL",
          "HTML/CSS",
          "React/Next.js",
          "C/C++",
          "AI/ML",
          "Tailwind CSS",
          "Full-Stack"
        ].map(skill => (
          <div
            class="rounded-full border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
          >
            {skill}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CURRENTLY EXPLORING -->
    <section class="animate-section-delay-2 mt-16">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">
        Currently Exploring
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Building systems that automate workflows
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Designing cleaner developer experiences
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Experimenting with productivity tooling & behavioral systems
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Learning scalable backend architecture
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Improving UI motion & interaction design
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5">
          Leaning AI fundamentals and Machine Learning concepts
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>



    <!-- STORY -->
    <section class="animate-section-delay-2 mt-16">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">My Story</h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-8 opacity-90">
        <p>
          Yoo, welcome potato people!! I’m Ganesh Macherla, or Machu for short
          (as people like to call me :p)
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m someone who never expected to get pulled this deeply into
          computers. At first, programming felt like just another boring subject for ners (no offence), but
          the more I explored, the more I realized how insanely creative the
          field actually gets.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every concept opens another rabbit hole, and somehow there’s always
          something new waiting on the other side. Curiosity is honestly what
          keeps pulling me forward.
        </p>

        <p>
          I’m still an amateur, not your brightest tool in the shed and have lots to learn. I haven’t built anything
          "world changing" yet, and I’m definitely not someone trying to pretend
          to be an expert. Most of my learning process still involves
          experimenting with random ideas, breaking things constantly, and
          spending hours trying to understand why something failed so
          miserably.
        </p>

        <p>
          Surprisingly, I enjoy that process.
        </p>

        <p>
          Being wrong means there’s still more left to understand. And that’s
           the most exciting part.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over time, this space slowly became more than just a website. It became
          a place where I could document my growth without feeling judged by others or embarrassed of the stupid things I do. This became a place where I share my projects and my failures,
          through experimentation, sudden late-night thoughts and random observations.
        </p>

        <p>
          So instead of treating this like a regular portfolio website that looks good on resume,
          pretending to like everythings perfect, think of it more like my evolving
          process or a documentary perhaps; where I learn from every success, and even more from every mistake. 
          
        </p>

            <!-- SOCIALS -->
    <section class="animate-section-delay-2 mt-16">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">
        Find Me Online
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Ganesh-Macherla"
          target="_blank"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent"
        >
          <p class="text-sm opacity-60">GitHub</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-1xl font-semibold">
            Ganesh-Macherla
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 opacity-80">
            Where most of my experiments and projects live. I need to touch grass.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ganesh-macherla-05713b319/"
          target="_blank"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent"
        >
          <p class="text-sm opacity-60">LinkedIn</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-1xl font-semibold">
            Ganesh Macherla
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 opacity-80">
            Professional updates, projects, work and experiences
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/just._.percussion?igsh=MTRyYXR6ZGIyaGVmaA=="
          target="_blank"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent"
        >
          <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Instagram</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-1xl font-semibold">
            just._.percussion
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 opacity-80">
            Music, edits, random thoughts, and everything in-between.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a
          href="mailto:myselfganesh65@example.com"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-accent"
        >
          <p class="text-sm opacity-60">Email</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 break-all text-1x1 font-semibold">
            myselfganesh65@gmail.com
            </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 opacity-80">
            For professional purposes, i guess
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

        </p>
        This one qoute really stands out to me, which says
        </p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-center text-2xl font-medium italic leading-relaxed text-accent opacity-90">
    “Becoming is better than being.”
    </p>

    <p class="mt-2 text-right text-sm tracking-wide opacity-60">
    — Carol Dweck
    </p>
    </main>

    <Footer />
    </Layout>